HeptaKernel

Original kernel implementation in this repository is provided under
GPL-2.0-only; see LICENSE. The .hepta sources are human-readable HIA source,
not generated C wrappers or opaque machine-code payloads.

The HIA toolchain is an external, pinned dependency from
https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Hepta at
f33d8da316de8fdf27b504371f1a5310997ff548. Its own license applies to that toolchain.
The native compiler binary and upstream compiler sources are not vendored here.

Reference files under third_party/linux are unmodified upstream reference
material from Linux v7.3.4, commit
7595a62d45ee1a2297eafa5f2ef5d0a45142d84d. Their original notices and the upstream
COPYING file are retained. These tables are inventories, not replacement Linux
implementation. Upstream license rules and the syscall exception are linked
from third_party/linux/COPYING.

The boot bridge in arch/x86_64/boot.S is an explicitly non-HIA component.
GNU binutils, QEMU and Python are build/test tools, not code hidden inside
the HIA allocator. Host tools are not counted as HIA kernel implementation.
